  "subdivision_of_building": "Ground Floor Flat 1",
  "status": "Approved",
  "description": "The proposal is for the installation of a new double-glazed uPVC window on the ground floor side elevation of a self-contained flat within a converted terraced house. The window will serve a bathroom that currently has no external openings.\n\nThe window will measure approximately 40cm wide by 100cm high and will be positioned to provide natural light and ventilation. It will be fitted with obscure glazing and a top-opening sash to ensure privacy. The proposed design will match the existing fenestration on the property in both style and material (white uPVC).\n\nThe side and rear elevations already contain multiple windows, and the addition of this window will not alter the overall appearance of the property. The works will not affect the external footprint and the window will not be visible from the public highway. The proposal will have no impact on the character or appearance of the surrounding area. The property is not listed and does not lie within a conservation area.",
